    {
      "id": "story.opening_01",
      "japanese": "{center}商人トルネコ。　彼は　かつて\n{center}天空にみちびかれし　勇者たちとともに\n{center}邪悪なる大魔王を　うちたおしました。",
      "english": "{center}Torneko, a merchant, once joined\n{center}heroes guided by the heavens\n{center}to defeat an evil demon king.",
      "context": "Opening narration, first three-line page; event command 0x27",
      "source_hex": "24638fa4906c8367838b836c83528142814094de82cd814082a982c282c40a246393568bf382c982dd82bf82d182a982ea82b5814097458ed282bd82bf82c682c682e082c90a24638ed788ab82c882e991e5968289a482f0814082a482bf82bd82a882b582dc82b582bd814200",
